### EAD-1) 기업 관리자 토큰으로 목록 접근 → 403
### 사전 조건: application.http 의 AP-1 실행해서 acmeToken 저장
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{acmeToken}}

> {%
    client.test("403 Forbidden", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 403, "expected 403 but got " + response.status);
    });
%}


### EAD-2) 인증 없이 목록 접근 → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/applications

> {%
    client.test("401 Unauthorized", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 401, "expected 401 but got " + response.status);
    });
%}


### EAD-3) 존재하지 않는 organizationId 상세 조회 → 404 APP_002
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/applications/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {%
    client.test("404 Not Found", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 404, "expected 404 but got " + response.status);
    });
    client.test("code APP_002", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.code === "APP_002");
    });
%}


### EAD-4) 반려 사유 누락 -> 400 COMMON_001
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/applications/{{firstOrgId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

> {%
    client.test("400 Bad Request", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 400);
    });
%}
